OL,3,APolice look for more than 100 gig-goers
OL,4,Ato help Co-op Live probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne woman was taken to hospital and 88
OL,7,Fothers were treated at the scene after
OL,8,Fconcertgoers reported a "horrible
OL,9,Fsmell" and some people "coughing up
OL,10,Fblood".
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
