OL,3,AKenyan doomsday cult leader convicted
OL,4,Aover further 123 deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA court in Kenya has convicted the
OL,7,Fleader of a doomsday Christian cult of
OL,8,Fthe manslaughter of 123 of his
OL,9,Ffollowers.
OL,11,FPaul Mackenzie was found guilty in
OL,12,FMombasa of ordering his followers, all
OL,13,Fadults, to fast to death in Shakahola
OL,14,Fforest near the coast between January
OL,15,F2021 and September 2023.
OL,17,FEarlier this month Mackenzie was jailed
OL,18,Ffor 200 years for murdering 191 people,
OL,19,Fall but one of them children, in the
OL,20,Fsame mass killing.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
